# concrete - poured, driving techno - the euclidean default
bpm 132
swing 20
humanize kick 4
humanize hat 4
humanize oh 4
humanize clap 4
humanize snare 4
humanize perc 4
humanize bass 4
humanize stab 4
kick x...x...x...x...
hat x.xx.xx.xx.xx.xx
filter hat hp 8500
oh ....x.......x...
gain oh 0.6
clap ....x.......x...
bass b1! c2 . . e2! a1~ f1 . . . g1 a1 . a1 b1 .
filter bass lp 420 res 0.8
sidechain bass 0.7
